{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necrowhisper is a co-op, online psychological horror game about investigating haunted locations. Read the story the building is trying to tell, gather hard evidence, and survive long enough to get out. Every expedition remixes clues, puzzles, and codes, so no two runs feel the same. Your sanity is always in play. Stay with the team to steady your nerves or go alone and risk everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is different. Clues, puzzles, and codes are remixed each time, so routes change, locks move, and logic chains never repeat in the same way. You will search for evidences. You will unlock drawers, piece together clues that only make sense once you see the full picture. Simple tools and careful teamwork matter more than brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity is always in play. Staying close to your team steadies your nerves and keeps the lights on. Wandering off opens paths and risks: footsteps behind you, whispers you cannot place, and a clock you cannot see. Low sanity makes mistakes more likely and the entity bolder. Choose when to regroup, when to push deeper, and when to cut your losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necrowhisper is about tension, not jump scares alone. It rewards observation, timing, and trust. Take notes; small details often decide who survives tonight. Read the environment, listen to your team, and keep moving. If you pay attention, the building will talk. If you panic, it will take you. Survive the night, solve the mystery, and get out together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer or Co-op Gameplay</strong><br>Play solo or team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op to investigate and survive chilling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/454e73bf1b0ad2f6b1a08b0d2b4b0d86.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/454e73bf1b0ad2f6b1a08b0d2b4b0d86.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/454e73bf1b0ad2f6b1a08b0d2b4b0d86.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Voice Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with teammates in real time using built-in voice chat, enhancing immersion and communication during tense moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Investigations</strong><br>Explore detailed, atmospheric environments, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind each mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/6b5cb82b1141fa29ab479e52f6fa15ea.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/6b5cb82b1141fa29ab479e52f6fa15ea.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/6b5cb82b1141fa29ab479e52f6fa15ea.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death's Door Mechanic</strong><br>When captured by a ghost, players enter a trance state where they can escape or pull another player in to take their place, creating intense strategic and moral decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/940a008aadea5a31fb8b9356e2eb2cb4.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/940a008aadea5a31fb8b9356e2eb2cb4.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/940a008aadea5a31fb8b9356e2eb2cb4.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters</strong> <br>Face terrifying phenomena that test your resolve and escalate the tension as you dig deeper into the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Note and Clue System</strong><br>Every playthrough features procedurally placed notes and puzzles that maintain narrative flow while keeping investigations fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/acf0d562f59dba48a3ebd791642b20ec.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/acf0d562f59dba48a3ebd791642b20ec.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/acf0d562f59dba48a3ebd791642b20ec.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in hauntingly crafted locations brought to life with cinematic visuals and immersive soundscapes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains flashing lights, sudden audio, hallucination effects, and jumpscares. Player discretion advised. For the best experience use headphones at a safe volume.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340890?t=1760954582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760954582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/3914552ea067f2a2f2629eaba56e039a75433337/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760954582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/3914552ea067f2a2f2629eaba56e039a75433337/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760954582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes depictions of blood, unsettling supernatural creatures, and flickering lights that may pose a seizure risk for sensitive individuals. Some evidence feature ropes in contexts that could suggest self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necrowhisper is a co-op, online psychological horror game about investigating haunted locations. Read the story the building is trying to tell, gather hard evidence, and survive long enough to get out. Every expedition remixes clues, puzzles, and codes, so no two runs feel the same. Your sanity is always in play. Stay with the team to steady your nerves or go alone and risk everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is different. Clues, puzzles, and codes are remixed each time, so routes change, locks move, and logic chains never repeat in the same way. You will search for evidences. You will unlock drawers, piece together clues that only make sense once you see the full picture. Simple tools and careful teamwork matter more than brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity is always in play. Staying close to your team steadies your nerves and keeps the lights on. Wandering off opens paths and risks: footsteps behind you, whispers you cannot place, and a clock you cannot see. Low sanity makes mistakes more likely and the entity bolder. Choose when to regroup, when to push deeper, and when to cut your losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necrowhisper is about tension, not jump scares alone. It rewards observation, timing, and trust. Take notes; small details often decide who survives tonight. Read the environment, listen to your team, and keep moving. If you pay attention, the building will talk. If you panic, it will take you. Survive the night, solve the mystery, and get out together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer or Co-op Gameplay</strong><br>Play solo or team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op to investigate and survive chilling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/454e73bf1b0ad2f6b1a08b0d2b4b0d86.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/454e73bf1b0ad2f6b1a08b0d2b4b0d86.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/454e73bf1b0ad2f6b1a08b0d2b4b0d86.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Voice Chat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with teammates in real time using built-in voice chat, enhancing immersion and communication during tense moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Investigations</strong><br>Explore detailed, atmospheric environments, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind each mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/6b5cb82b1141fa29ab479e52f6fa15ea.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/6b5cb82b1141fa29ab479e52f6fa15ea.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/6b5cb82b1141fa29ab479e52f6fa15ea.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death's Door Mechanic</strong><br>When captured by a ghost, players enter a trance state where they can escape or pull another player in to take their place, creating intense strategic and moral decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/940a008aadea5a31fb8b9356e2eb2cb4.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/940a008aadea5a31fb8b9356e2eb2cb4.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/940a008aadea5a31fb8b9356e2eb2cb4.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters</strong> <br>Face terrifying phenomena that test your resolve and escalate the tension as you dig deeper into the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Note and Clue System</strong><br>Every playthrough features procedurally placed notes and puzzles that maintain narrative flow while keeping investigations fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/acf0d562f59dba48a3ebd791642b20ec.poster.avif?t=1760954582\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/acf0d562f59dba48a3ebd791642b20ec.webm?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/extras/acf0d562f59dba48a3ebd791642b20ec.mp4?t=1760954582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in hauntingly crafted locations brought to life with cinematic visuals and immersive soundscapes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains flashing lights, sudden audio, hallucination effects, and jumpscares. Player discretion advised. For the best experience use headphones at a safe volume.</p>","developers":["Samudra Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340890/header.jpg?t=1760954582","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3340890/874000/d008a8c9f0cbc5e21671a13848660da680ac8e4d/1750841753/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745168680","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3340890/874000/d008a8c9f0cbc5e21671a13848660da680ac8e4d/1750841753/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745168680","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3340890/874000/d008a8c9f0cbc5e21671a13848660da680ac8e4d/1750841753/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745168680","id":257128377,"nam